        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amatsi akarula muluanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omukhung'aano kwosi kwabaana baIsiraeli bachenda okhurula mushitsiimi shiaSini, nibakonelanga khunjila, shinga olwa OMWAMI yabalakanga, nibakhoma ikambi yabwe eRefidimu; ne amatsi kali nikabulaho aka abandu banywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila abandu nibasoolasia Musa, nibasunga bari Okhuheelesie amatsi khunywe. Naye Musa nabasunjila mbu Olwashiina nimusooasia? Kata muteemanga OMWAMI mbushiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuloho nibulia abandu ebweneyo; abandu abo nibabuuluulila Musa, bari Okhutikulusiye okhurula eMisiri mbushiina, mbu okhukhwira nobuloho, ifwe halala nende abaana nende emiruko chieefwe, noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Musa namuhaabila OMWAMI, ari Nembakholele endie abandu bano? Beengana abeenya okhundasa namachina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namubiila Musa ari Bira imbeli wabandu, ne obe nende abandi abokhubakofu baIsiraeli; khandi indabushiyo eya wakhupila Omwalo kwaNaili, ochibukule mumukhono otsie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, ndalasinjila imbeliwo, yaho khulwanda eHorebu; nawe olakhupa olwanda, mana amatsi kalarulamwo, mbu abandu banywe. Musa nakhola ario imbeli wabakofu baIsiraeli, nibalola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakulikha habundu yaho eliira mbu Masa, nende Meriba, khulwa okhusoolasia khwabaana baIsiraeii, khand; shichila bateema OMWAMI, nibasunga bari OMWAMI ali hakari mwifwe nohomba?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lihe liabaAmaleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abaAmaleki nibeetsa nibaseera Isiraeli eRefidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa namusunjila Yoswa ari Okhulobolele abandu, otsie oseerane nende abaAmaleki; mukamba ndalasinjila khubutenje bweshikulu nindi nende indabushi yaNyasave mumukhono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoswa yakhola shinga Musa olwa yali namusunjiile, naseerana nende Amaleki; nabo Musa, nende Haruni, nende Huri, nibaniina okhuula khubutenje bweshikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Musa yachinganga omukhono, Isiraeli bayombeelelanga; ne olwa yeesinjia omukhono, Amaleki bayombeelelanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amakhono kaMusa kaluyilila; kho babukula lichina nibara hasiwe, naye niyeekhalakhwo; nabo Haruni nende Huri nibamutiilila amakhono oundi elubeka noundi elubeka; amakhonoke nikaralila okhuula eliuba niliyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoswa yakoyaasia Amaleki nende abandube netsinganga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila Musa ari Handiika kano kabe eshiitsulilo mushitabo, nokatoonya mumarwi kaYoswa; mbu ndalasiliisilia elala okhwitsulilwa khwaAmaleki hasi welikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Musa niyoombakha eshimalilo shiemisango, nashikulikha eliira mbu Yahwehnisi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nasunga ari Tiile khumbendela yOMWAMI; OMWAMI alaseerananga nende Amaleki ebisoni nebisoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
